1 DOCUMENT 
2 TITL JL TANCERMAN - Klochendler family tree
2 DESCRIPTION 
3 CONT This is the KLOCHENDLER portion of my family tree. It was initially co
3 CONC mpiled on paper in 1961 with my father Jacques and grandmother Léa Tan
3 CONC cerman, and grand-uncle David Klochendler, and I've erratically mainta
3 CONC ined it through the past 45 years or so, with the help of cousins over
3 CONC  2 continents. It is however quite incomplete, as the family has branc
3 CONC hed out exponentially through 4 or even 5 generations since then, and 
3 CONC I would deeply appreciate all relevant input regarding family members 
3 CONC past and present: names, dates of birth, etc. Hope you enjoy this gene
3 CONC alogy  in its present state. 
3 CONT 
3 CONT Note: click the Menu symbol at top left (3 horizontal bars) and choose
3 CONC  the genealogy "view" you want : the graphical TREE view is best suite
3 CONC d with a computer or tablet, other views are ok with a phone. You can 
3 CONC zoom, pan, drag the graphical tree for exploring, and click all items 
3 CONC (names, links) for more details. Enjoy ! 
3 CONT 
3 CONT Your comments are welcome, as always.
3 CONT Jean-Louis Tancerman
3 CONT jltancerman@outlook.fr 
3 CONT 
